Bards greet Bharata with auspicious hymns at night --- Drums conches and instruments pierce grieving Bharata --- Awakened Bharata silences music disclaiming kingship --- Bharata mourns rudderless royal Lakṣmī and fallen king --- Watching women wail at senseless Bharata --- Vasiṣṭha enters golden Ikṣvāku assembly --- Vasiṣṭha summons brāhmaṇas warriors ministers in haste --- Subjects hail arriving Bharata like Daśaratha of old
